{"2131660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call of the Golden Valley", "steam_appid": 2131660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of the Golden Valley is a thrilling true crime-like mystery game with an immersive narrative set in a charming but eerie Australian country town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Danielle, an American tourist travelling to an old town in the Australian countryside to visit her friend Marisa. Upon arrival, you discover that Marisa is not only nowhere to be found, but that she’s actually one of the many people who have recently vanished without a trace from this seemingly harmless small country town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to save your friend, you must search the internet for clues, solve mysterious puzzles and uncover the conspiracy behind the vanishing hikers of Golden Valley.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fa63fda0a9d55c1125fe49848c99b0c5.poster.avif?t=1772847448\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fa63fda0a9d55c1125fe49848c99b0c5.webm?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fa63fda0a9d55c1125fe49848c99b0c5.mp4?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story by solving compelling puzzles, deciphering clues contained within objects you find and conversing with the quirky townsfolk of a small country town in the Australian outback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your Theory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fc6f39bc83c33a777acd9d3a9f83afec.poster.avif?t=1772847448\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fc6f39bc83c33a777acd9d3a9f83afec.webm?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fc6f39bc83c33a777acd9d3a9f83afec.mp4?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your deduction board to connect the dots between the evidence you’ve gathered through searching the in-game internet and by exploring the local environment. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover the Conspiracy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/221a888336837c56b41f668e3fdc8d8e.poster.avif?t=1772847448\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/221a888336837c56b41f668e3fdc8d8e.webm?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/221a888336837c56b41f668e3fdc8d8e.mp4?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br>Discover all of this seemingly innocent country town’s secrets and solve the mystery of Golden Valley’s vanishing hikers before it’s too late to save your friend’s life.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of the Golden Valley takes most players between 5 and 10 hours to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of the Golden Valley is a thrilling true crime-like mystery game with an immersive narrative set in a charming but eerie Australian country town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Danielle, an American tourist travelling to an old town in the Australian countryside to visit her friend Marisa. Upon arrival, you discover that Marisa is not only nowhere to be found, but that she’s actually one of the many people who have recently vanished without a trace from this seemingly harmless small country town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to save your friend, you must search the internet for clues, solve mysterious puzzles and uncover the conspiracy behind the vanishing hikers of Golden Valley.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fa63fda0a9d55c1125fe49848c99b0c5.poster.avif?t=1772847448\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fa63fda0a9d55c1125fe49848c99b0c5.webm?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fa63fda0a9d55c1125fe49848c99b0c5.mp4?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story by solving compelling puzzles, deciphering clues contained within objects you find and conversing with the quirky townsfolk of a small country town in the Australian outback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your Theory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fc6f39bc83c33a777acd9d3a9f83afec.poster.avif?t=1772847448\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fc6f39bc83c33a777acd9d3a9f83afec.webm?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fc6f39bc83c33a777acd9d3a9f83afec.mp4?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your deduction board to connect the dots between the evidence you’ve gathered through searching the in-game internet and by exploring the local environment. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover the Conspiracy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/221a888336837c56b41f668e3fdc8d8e.poster.avif?t=1772847448\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/221a888336837c56b41f668e3fdc8d8e.webm?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/221a888336837c56b41f668e3fdc8d8e.mp4?t=1772847448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br>Discover all of this seemingly innocent country town’s secrets and solve the mystery of Golden Valley’s vanishing hikers before it’s too late to save your friend’s life.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of the Golden Valley takes most players between 5 and 10 hours to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Your friend is missing in the Australian outback and you must find her. Search the Internet for clues, solve mysterious puzzles and uncover the conspiracy of the vanishing hikers of Golden Valley.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/c5bbaed64b4fcc8f85f0639a4c5548c062434947/header.jpg?t=1772847448", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/e75580e956320199a5593d1eb8f946d9bf41da36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772847448", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/e75580e956320199a5593d1eb8f946d9bf41da36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772847448", "website": "http://www.osaurusstudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7+<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce RTX 2080+ / AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT+ <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A pen &amp; notebook</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 11+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7+/Apple M1+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommen